            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Visit Transaction Monitoring & Actions Page</p>
            <p>Navigates to a specific Settings → Transaction Monitoring submenu item and validates its page.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> index = route.index, expectedPath = route.route, expectedText = route.assertion</p>
            <step>Visit dashboard → Pin sidebar if unpinned.</step>
            <step>Open Settings → Transaction Monitoring menu.</step>
            <step>Click submenu item by index.</step>
